REGIONAL REGULATION OF EAST HALMAHERA REGENCY
NUMBER 7 OF 2022
CONCERNING
PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN
BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
THE REGENT OF EAST HALMAHERA,

Considering: a. that women and children have the right to obtain a sense of security and freedom from all forms of torture or treatment that degrades human dignity and honor;
b. that all forms of acts of violence against women and children constitute violations of human rights so that their dignity and honor need to be protected and their right to life guaranteed in accordance with their nature and destiny without discrimination;
c. that based on Article 12 of Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government, women's empowerment and child protection are mandatory governmental affairs for regional governments;
d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letters a, b, and c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation of East Halmahera Regency concerning Protection of Women and Children;

